{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1210517-pardon-my-derp-got-a-few-questions-on-the-hero-2e-rules","id":1210517,"title":"Pardon my derp, got a few questions on the hero 2e rules.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-23T11:53:52-07:00","id":1210517,"title":"Pardon my derp, got a few questions on the hero 2e rules.","content":"I'm making my way through the manuscript and I have some questions.<br /> <br /> Do characters only receive the fate bindings listed in their role description?<br /> <br /> Do paths have ratings? Is it possible to aquire more than three? <br /> <br /> What mechanical effect do virtues have?<br /> <br /> Can you aquire additional innate perviews?<br /> <br /> When can you switch out which of your known knacks are active and which arnt?<br /> <br /> are the two starting boons you get in addition to the boons listed In the &quot;what legend gives you&quot; chart in the traits section?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6111-thecosmicgoose","user":"thecosmicgoose","date":".  Thought of more questions 04-23-2018, 03:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6111-thecosmicgoose","name":"thecosmicgoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T12:32:19-07:00","id":1210541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thecosmicgoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1210517-pardon-my-derp-got-a-few-questions-on-the-hero-2e-rules#post1210517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm making my way through the manuscript and I have some questions.<br /> <br /> Do characters only receive the fate bindings listed in their role description?<br /> <br /> Do paths have ratings? Is it possible to aquire more than three?<br /> <br /> What mechanical effect do virtues have?<br /> <br /> Can you aquire additional innate perviews?<br /> <br /> When can you switch out which of your known knacks are active and which arnt?<br /> <br /> are the two starting boons you get in addition to the boons listed In the &quot;what legend gives you&quot; chart in the traits section?</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Good Question. I would consider them suggestions but not hard rules.<br /> <br /> 2. No, they do not have ratings, but you can have as many as you can narratively justify.<br /> <br /> 3. When at either end of the Track, you gain additional dice while spending Momentum to add dice to a roll.<br /> <br /> 4. Not at Hero, no.<br /> <br /> 5. Normally at the beginning of every session, but there is an optional rule suggested that lets you 'fill them in' so to speak during the session as you need them, provided you don't change them after that.<br /> <br /> 6. The Legend-Boon chart is off by one... your total number of Boons = Legend + 1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T12:40:55-07:00","id":1213152,"title":"","content":"Also, there's been quite a few questions asked on the Discord. <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1etYiuHfHR-nTI5obsKhL44stbRmLkuvw2Z6qae_lbWM\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>, I've been collecting a few of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}